  "description" : "Kurebayashi Teru, a high school student, starts to receive emails on the cell phone she received from her late brother Souichirou, her only relative. The emails, sent by a mysterious figure named \"Daisy,\" become her sole support in life following Souichirou`s passing. One day, after accidentally breaking a window at school, Teru ends up working for Kurosaki Tasuku, the school custodian. Kurosaki is sharp-tongued and works her to the bone, but for some reason, he kindly looks out for Teru. And after meeting Kurosaki, Teru`s fate starts to change drastically...\nSource: Official Website",
